# Admin panel (apps/admin) — Vite env
#
# Local dev: leave VITE_API_URL EMPTY (vite.config.js proxies to :5000).
#
# Production (Cloudflare Pages → admin project → Settings → Environment
# variables → add for both Production and Preview):
#   VITE_API_URL = https://api.lpludoplayer.com
#
# The API must list this panel's origin in CORS_ORIGINS
# (https://admin.lpludoplayer.com) or every request is blocked by CORS.
VITE_API_URL=
